[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12904.389, "timestamp": "03:35:04", "text": "ええ、これは私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12907.67, "timestamp": "03:35:07", "text": "お気に入りだよ。もうすぐだと思う。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12910.349, "timestamp": "03:35:10", "text": "もうすぐだ。それを提供する。私はしません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12913.71, "timestamp": "03:35:13", "text": "知る。でも私はいくつか作りました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12916.07, "timestamp": "03:35:16", "text": "間違い。これは良いもの、あるいは何か良いもの。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12918.221, "timestamp": "03:35:18", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "THIS CLOSE... RIGHT THERE"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12918.55, "timestamp": "03:35:18", "text": "うん、練習しないといけない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12921.99, "timestamp": "03:35:21", "text": "イントネーションだけではない、すべてを学ぶ方法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12923.83, "timestamp": "03:35:23", "text": "呼吸のように、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12925.429, "timestamp": "03:35:25", "text": "すべて。いいえ、何も知りません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12929.03, "timestamp": "03:35:29", "text": "歌について。学びたい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12932.71, "timestamp": "03:35:32", "text": "もう一つのお気に入りは肉食です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12933.87, "timestamp": "03:35:33", "text": "1つずつ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12938.469, "timestamp": "03:35:38", "text": "リム。私の私のワイフはこの子牛です。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12940.389, "timestamp": "03:35:40", "text": "なぜこんなにたくさんの歌を歌っているのか分からない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12943.99, "timestamp": "03:35:43", "text": "縁よりも縁よりもふくらはぎですが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12946.95, "timestamp": "03:35:46", "text": "それを変えなければならない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12950.229, "timestamp": "03:35:50", "text": "うん、カニエのプランも私のお気に入りだよ。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12954.266, "timestamp": "03:35:54", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clV